<title>PHILIPPINES: MUI Resources Q3 net at 20.147 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>MUI Resources Q3 net at 20.147 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hotel operator MUI Resources Philippines Inc said on Friday it posted a net income of 20.147 million pesos during the third quarter of the year.</p>
<p>The figures include earnings from its subsidiaries.</p>
<p>No other details were immediately available.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
